                                "sense_id": "88ac402b-3daf-3bbc-99a0-0f70b346860a",
                                "text": "Yohji Yamamoto's strength was to stick with the sportswear that has inspired him since he teamed up with Adidas to create the imaginative pin-striped or painted-denim footwear that walked his grass-turf runway."
                            }
                        ]
